# Optional. Enables the Google Drive cloud sync option in Settings.
# Create an OAuth 2.0 "Web application" client ID in the Google Cloud
# Console (APIs & Services -> Credentials), and add your deployed origin
# (plus http://localhost:5173 for local dev) under "Authorized JavaScript
# origins". See README.md -> "Cloud sync" for the full walkthrough.
#
# Leave unset to run Family Care Hub as a fully local, no-sync app.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
